! Single-wire SWER conductor (e.g. 3/2.75 SC/GZ).  One phase; the return path is
! the earth, established by the grounding reactors at the isolating transformer
! star point and at each distribution-transformer pole earth (see Groundings.dss).
New Linecode.swer nphases=1
~ Rmatrix=[1.2]
~ Xmatrix=[0.75]
~ Cmatrix=[0]
~ units=km
